id=sheng_recents_cpu_boost_v1
name=Sheng Recents Source-App Yield
version=1.0
versionCode=14
author=Codex
description=Leaves launcher scheduling untouched. A lightweight event listener caches the latest resumed source app, which yields at the earliest Overview-toggle signal. MIMD and wallpaper briefly move off performance cores, then restore. Launcher, SystemUI, IME, and display chain are protected. No broad scan or frequency lock.
